{"vid":"qfQ61oYIbxY","source":"qfQ61oYIbxY.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Hi Georgie, how are you today?"},{"t":1.7,"txt":"I'm pretty good today, thank you, Neil. How are you?"},{"t":6,"txt":"I am much better than I was this morning."},{"t":10.4,"txt":"Oh. How were you feeling this morning?"},{"t":12.3,"txt":"I was really grumpy."},{"t":14.7,"txt":"Oh! Why is that?"},{"t":16.7,"txt":"Well, I'll tell you in a minute, but that's what we're talking"},{"t":19.3,"txt":"about today – being grumpy, which means being in a bad mood."},{"t":24.3,"txt":"Yes, but before we begin, our listeners need to know"},{"t":27.8,"txt":"that they can find a worksheet, a free worksheet, on our website"},{"t":32.1,"txt":"at bbclearningenglish.com."},{"t":39.8,"txt":"So, you said you were feeling grumpy this morning."},{"t":42.8,"txt":"I didn't notice that."},{"t":44.9,"txt":"Why were you feeling grumpy this morning?"},{"t":47.2,"txt":"I get really grumpy if I'm hungry or tired,"},{"t":51.8,"txt":"and very, very grumpy if I'm hungry and tired."},{"t":55.5,"txt":"Oh no! Is that how you were feeling this morning then?"},{"t":58.1,"txt":"Yeah. It's very hot at the moment – difficult to sleep."},{"t":61.8,"txt":"Yeah."},{"t":62.5,"txt":"And we also didn't have any food"},{"t":66,"txt":"in the fridge, so I came to work hungry and tired,"},{"t":71.9,"txt":"and so I was grumpy."},{"t":73.7,"txt":"Oh well, you hid it very well."},{"t":75.7,"txt":"I didn't notice that."},{"t":77.6,"txt":"I've felt cheerful all day so far."},{"t":80.3,"txt":"Well, you're always cheerful, Georgie."},{"t":82.2,"txt":"Or are you?"},{"t":85,"txt":"I... No, I'm not always cheerful."},{"t":88,"txt":"Mostly, I have to say, mostly I am."},{"t":91,"txt":"But there are certain times of the month that make me feel very grumpy."},{"t":96.9,"txt":"And when I'm in a bad mood, I become a bit irritable."},{"t":103.1,"txt":"Small things that other people do annoy me."},{"t":107.5,"txt":"And sometimes it's not for any reason or it's for a very small reason"},{"t":112.3,"txt":"and I shouldn't be so grumpy."},{"t":114.4,"txt":"OK. Georgie, what kind of things make you grumpy?"},{"t":118,"txt":"Well, as I said, there are certain times of the month where I feel grumpy,"},{"t":122.3,"txt":"but other things that make me grumpy..."},{"t":125.1,"txt":"Usually, if it's a really sunny day outside and I'm stuck inside working,"},{"t":131.2,"txt":"that makes me feel a bit grumpy because I would prefer to be outside in the sun,"},{"t":137.2,"txt":"in the park, spending time in the fresh air, but instead I'm working."},{"t":142.7,"txt":"So, you said that you're grumpy when you're hungry or tired."},{"t":147.4,"txt":"What kind of things do you do to cheer yourself up?"},{"t":151.5,"txt":"Ah yeah, 'to cheer myself up' – to feel better."},{"t":155.2,"txt":"Well, eat something and sleep."},{"t":159.4,"txt":"But I guess also do something relaxing."},{"t":164,"txt":"Maybe do some exercise."},{"t":165.6,"txt":"Exercise is a really good thing to lift your mood."},{"t":170.9,"txt":"Yes. I, as I said, like to be outside."},{"t":175,"txt":"That will make me..."},{"t":176.5,"txt":"That will put me in a better mood."},{"t":178.5,"txt":"Going for a walk in the park, being in nature with some fresh air."},{"t":184,"txt":"I also really like to put some upbeat music on and dance around my bedroom."},{"t":190.8,"txt":"I like doing that."},{"t":192.4,"txt":"That cheers me up."},{"t":193.6,"txt":"OK. I think that would cheer everybody up."},{"t":196.1,"txt":"What? If they got to watch it?"},{"t":197.7,"txt":"Yeah!"},{"t":199.3,"txt":"What do you think about people who are always grumpy?"},{"t":204.7,"txt":"I do know someone who's always grumpy, but he's so grumpy, it's almost funny."},{"t":212.9,"txt":"Yeah?"},{"t":213.4,"txt":"Like, he knows he's grumpy."},{"t":215.7,"txt":"And people make little jokes about it and he, kind of, knows he's grumpy."},{"t":222.7,"txt":"Mmm. So, it's entertaining for you."},{"t":225.1,"txt":"Yeah. But it's still not really that nice to be close to."},{"t":229.5,"txt":"Yeah. A bit of a negative energy."},{"t":231.8,"txt":"Absolutely."},{"t":233,"txt":"Georgie are you good at hiding it when you are grumpy?"},{"t":237,"txt":"Well, apparently I am, because I sometimes am grumpy"},{"t":242,"txt":"and you said that I never seem grumpy, so maybe I am very good at hiding it."},{"t":247.2,"txt":"I think it's good not to let other people feel"},{"t":251.6,"txt":"your negativity coming out of you,"},{"t":254.9,"txt":"but on the other hand I think it's also good to share how you feel sometimes."},{"t":260.5,"txt":"OK. So, perhaps you are really grumpy right now..."},{"t":264.2,"txt":"Yeah."},{"t":265,"txt":"...even though you seem cheerful."},{"t":266.1,"txt":"Even though I have a big smile on my face, yeah."},{"t":268.5,"txt":"It's because I've had a coffee."},{"t":270.8,"txt":"I'm feeling good."},{"t":277.4,"txt":"OK. Georgie, it's time now to recap the language"},{"t":280.6,"txt":"that we've used in this podcast."},{"t":282.9,"txt":"Yes, we had 'grumpy', which means easily annoyed, negative or in a bad mood."},{"t":289.3,"txt":"Yes, 'in a bad mood'."},{"t":290.8,"txt":"And the opposite of that is 'in a good mood',"},{"t":293.7,"txt":"when you're feeling happy and cheerful."},{"t":296.6,"txt":"'Cheerful' is another word we heard today."},{"t":298.9,"txt":"Yes, 'cheerful' is another word for happy,"},{"t":301.9,"txt":"but you show it in an obvious way, maybe by smiling."},{"t":305.1,"txt":"Yep. And we've got the phrasal verb 'cheer up',"},{"t":308.1,"txt":"which means to become happy or cheerful."},{"t":311.7,"txt":"Yes. For example, I cheer myself up by dancing alone in my bedroom."},{"t":317.2,"txt":"That's it for this episode of Real Easy English,"},{"t":319.5,"txt":"but come back next week for another episode."},{"t":322.4,"txt":"Yes. And don't forget, you can find a free transcript and worksheet"},{"t":326,"txt":"to practise what you've learnt on our website, bbclearningenglish.com."},{"t":330.3,"txt":"Goodbye for now."},{"t":331.2,"txt":"Goodbye."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Hi"},{"t":0,"w":"Georgie,"},{"t":0,"w":"how"},{"t":0,"w":"are"},{"t":0,"w":"you"},{"t":0,"w":"today?"},{"t":1.68,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.68,"w":"pretty"},{"t":1.68,"w":"good"},{"t":1.68,"w":"today,"},{"t":1.68,"w":"thank"},{"t":1.68,"w":"you,"},{"t":1.68,"w":"Neil."},{"t":1.68,"w":"How"},{"t":1.68,"w":"are"},{"t":1.68,"w":"you?"},{"t":6.04,"w":"I"},{"t":6.04,"w":"am"},{"t":6.04,"w":"much"},{"t":6.04,"w":"better"},{"t":6.04,"w":"than"},{"t":6.04,"w":"I"},{"t":6.04,"w":"was"},{"t":6.04,"w":"this"},{"t":6.04,"w":"morning."},{"t":10.44,"w":"Oh."},{"t":10.44,"w":"How"},{"t":10.44,"w":"were"},{"t":10.44,"w":"you"},{"t":10.44,"w":"feeling"},{"t":10.44,"w":"this"},{"t":10.44,"w":"morning?"},{"t":12.32,"w":"I"},{"t":12.32,"w":"was"},{"t":12.32,"w":"really"},{"t":12.32,"w":"grumpy."},{"t":14.68,"w":"Oh!"},{"t":14.68,"w":"Why"},{"t":14.68,"w":"is"},{"t":14.68,"w":"that?"},{"t":16.72,"w":"Well,"},{"t":16.72,"w":"I'll"},{"t":16.72,"w":"tell"},{"t":16.72,"w":"you"},{"t":16.72,"w":"in"},{"t":16.72,"w":"a"},{"t":16.72,"w":"minute,"},{"t":16.72,"w":"but"},{"t":16.72,"w":"that's"},{"t":16.72,"w":"what"},{"t":16.72,"w":"we're"},{"t":16.72,"w":"talking"},{"t":19.28,"w":"about"},{"t":19.28,"w":"today"},{"t":19.28,"w":"–"},{"t":19.28,"w":"being"},{"t":19.28,"w":"grumpy,"},{"t":19.28,"w":"which"},{"t":19.28,"w":"means"},{"t":19.28,"w":"being"},{"t":19.28,"w":"in"},{"t":19.28,"w":"a"},{"t":19.28,"w":"bad"},{"t":19.28,"w":"mood."},{"t":24.28,"w":"Yes,"},{"t":24.28,"w":"but"},{"t":24.28,"w":"before"},{"t":24.28,"w":"we"},{"t":24.28,"w":"begin,"},{"t":24.28,"w":"our"},{"t":24.28,"w":"listeners"},{"t":24.28,"w":"need"},{"t":24.28,"w":"to"},{"t":24.28,"w":"know"},{"t":27.84,"w":"that"},{"t":27.84,"w":"they"},{"t":27.84,"w":"can"},{"t":27.84,"w":"find"},{"t":27.84,"w":"a"},{"t":27.84,"w":"worksheet,"},{"t":27.84,"w":"a"},{"t":27.84,"w":"free"},{"t":27.84,"w":"worksheet,"},{"t":27.